Creates a circle of radius [2, 3, 3, 4, 4 (TL1-5)] at your feet; the circle lights up affected tiles, increases your positive energy by [3, 3, 4, 4, 5 (TL1-5; SP 100)] each turn and deals [8.18, 11, 13, 15, 17 (TL1-5; SP 100)] light damage and [8.18, 11, 13, 15, 17 (TL1-5; SP 100)] fire damage per turn to everyone else within its radius.  The circle lasts [4, 5, 6, 7, 8 (TL1-5)] turns.

The damage will increase with your Spellpower.
